trong>Post Name</strong></td>\n<td style=\"text-align: center;width: 19.764%;height: 25px\" colspan=\"2\"><strong>Total Post</strong></td>\n<td style=\"text-align: center;width: 104.26%;height: 25px\" colspan=\"6\"><strong>UPSC Combined Geologist Eligibility</strong></td>\n</tr>\n<tr style=\"height: 23px\">\n<td style=\"text-align: center;height: 23px;width: 25.0604%\" colspan=\"3\">Geologist, Group A</td>\n<td style=\"text-align: center;height: 23px;width: 19.764%\" colspan=\"2\">29</td>\n<td style=\"height: 23px;width: 104.26%;text-align: left\" colspan=\"6\">\n<ul>\n<li>Master Degree in Geological Science OR Geology OR Applied Geology OR Geo Exploration OR mineral Exploration or Engineering Geology OR Marine Geology or Earth Science and Resource Management or Oceanography.</li>\n</ul>\n</td>\n</tr>\n<tr style=\"height: 23px\">\n<td style=\"text-align: center;height: 23px;width: 25.0604%\" colspan=\"3\">Chemist, Group A</td>\n<td style=\"text-align: center;height: 23px;width: 19.764%\" colspan=\"2\">07</td>\n<td style=\"height: 23px;width: 104.26%;text-align: left\" colspan=\"6\">\n<ul>\n<li>Master Degree in Chemistry.</li>\n</ul>\n</td>\n</tr>\n<tr style=\"height: 23px\">\n<td style=\"text-align: center;height: 23px;width: 25.0604%\" colspan=\"3\">Assistant Geologist, Group B</td>\n<td style=\"text-align: center;height: 23px;width: 19.764%\" colspan=\"2\">34</td>\n<td style=\"height: 23px;width: 104.26%;text-align: left\" colspan=\"6\">\n<ul>\n<li>Master Degree in Geology / Applied Geology / Mineral Exploration / Marine Geology / Earth Science.</li>\n</ul>\n</td>\n</tr>\n<tr style=\"height: 23px\">\n<td style=\"text-align: center;height: 23px;width: 25.0604%\" colspan=\"3\">Assistant Geophysicist, Group B</td>\n<td style=\"text-align: center;height: 23px;width: 19.764%\" colspan=\"2\">35</td>\n<td style=\"height: 23px;width: 104.26%;text-align: left\" colspan=\"6\">\n<ul>\n<li>Master Degree in Geophysics / Exploration Geophysics / Applied Geophysics / Equivalent.</li>\n</ul>\n</td>\n</tr>\n<tr style=\"height: 23px\">\n<td style=\"text-align: center;height: 23px;width: 25.0604%\" colspan=\"3\">Assistant Chemist, Group B</td>\n<td style=\"text-align: center;height: 23px;width: 19.764%\" colspan=\"2\">06</td>\n<td style=\"height: 23px;width: 104.26%;text-align: left\" colspan=\"6\">\n<ul>\n<li>Master Degree in Chemistry / Applied Chemistry / Analytical Chemistry / Physical Chemistry / Equivalent.</li>\n</ul>\n</td>\n</tr>\n<tr style=\"height: 23px\">\n<td style=\"text-align: center;height: 23px;width: 25.0604%\" colspan=\"3\">Scientist ‘B’(Hydrogeology), Group ‘A’</td>\n<td style=\"text-align: center;height: 23px;width: 19.764%\" colspan=\"2\">05</td>\n<td style=\"height: 23px;width: 104.26%;text-align: left\" colspan=\"6\">\n<ul>\n<li>Master Degree in Geology / Marine Geology / Hydrogeology / Equivalent.</li>\n</ul>\n</td>\n</tr>\n<tr style=\"height: 23px\">\n<td style=\"text-align: center;height: 23px;width: 25.0604%\" colspan=\"3\">Scientist ‘B’(Chemical ) Group ‘A’</td>\n<td style=\"text-align: center;height: 23px;width: 19.764%\" colspan=\"2\">01</td>\n<td style=\"height: 23px;width: 104.26%;text-align: left\" colspan=\"6\">\n<ul>\n<li>Master Degree in Physics OR Applied Physics / Geophysics / Equivalent.</li>\n</ul>\n</td>\n</tr>\n<tr style=\"height: 23px\">\n<td style=\"text-align: center;height: 23px;width: 25.0604%\" colspan=\"3\">Scientist ‘B’(Geophysics) Group ‘A’</td>\n<td style=\"text-align: center;height: 23px;width: 19.764%\" colspan=\"2\">01</td>\n<td style=\"height: 23px;width: 104.26%;text-align: left\" colspan=\"6\">\n<ul>\n<li>Master Degree in Physics OR Geophysics / Integrated Exploration Geophysics OR Applied Geophysics OR Marine Geophysics OR Equivalent Degree.</li>\n</ul>\n</td>\n</tr>\n<tr style=\"height: 23px\">\n<td style=\"text-align: center;height: 23px;width: 25.0604%\" colspan=\"3\">Assistant Hydrogeologist, Group ‘B’</td>\n<td style=\"text-align: center;height: 23px;width: 19.764%\" colspan=\"2\">07</td>\n<td style=\"height: 23px;width: 104.26%;text-align: left\" colspan=\"6\">\n<ul>\n<li>Master Degree in Geology / Marine Geology / Hydrogeology / Equivalent.</li>\n</ul>\n</td>\n</tr>\n<tr style=\"height: 23px\">\n<td style=\"text-align: center;height: 23px;width: 25.0604%\" colspan=\"3\">Assistant Chemist, Group ‘B’</td>\n<td style=\"text-align: center;height: 23px;width: 19.764%\" colspan=\"2\">01</td>\n<td style=\"height: 23px;width: 104.26%;text-align: left\" colspan=\"6\">\n<ul>\n<li>Master Degree in Chemistry / Applied Chemistry / Analytical Chemistry / Physical Chemistry / Equivalent.</li>\n</ul>\n</td>\n</tr>\n<tr style=\"height: 23px\">\n<td style=\"text-align: center;height: 23px;width: 25.0604%\" colspan=\"3\">Assistant Geophysicist, Group ‘B’</td>\n<td style=\"text-align: center;height: 23px;width: 19.764%\" colspan=\"2\">01</td>\n<td style=\"height: 23px;width: 104.26%;text-align: left\" colspan=\"6\">\n<ul>\n<li>Master Degree in Geophysics / Exploration Geophysics / Applied Geophysics / Equivalent.</li>\n</ul>\n</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td style=\"width: 149.084%\" colspan=\"11\">\n\n<ul>\n<li>Union Public Service Commission (UPSC) Are Issued CGSPE Combined Geo Scientist Examination 2027. Notification and Invited Online Application Form for the UPSC Combined Geo Scientist Recruitment 2027 Candidate Can Apply Online for <b>02/09/2026 to 22/09/2026.</b></li>\n<li>Candidate Read the Notification Before Apply the UPSC Latest Recruitment 2027 Application Form in Sarkari Result Recruitment Latest Job Section.</li>\n<li>Kindly Check and Collect the All Document – Hand Writing, Eligibility, ID Proof, Address Details, Basic Details.</li>\n<li>Kindly Ready Scan Document Related to Recruitment Form – Photo, Sign, ID, Thumb, Proof, Etc.</li>\n<li>Before Submit the Application Form Must Check the Preview and All Column Carefully.</li>\n<li>If Candidate Required to Paying the Application Fee Must Submit. If You have Not the Required Application Fees Your Form is Not Completed.</li>\n<li>Take A Print Out of Final Submitted Form.</li>\n<li>For the latest updates on Sarkari Result, admit card, answer key, and result, always visit SarkariResult.com, the official website for Sarkari Result in India (Since 2012).</li>\n</ul>\n</td>\n</tr>\n<tr style=\"height: 104px\">\n<td style=\"width: 149.084%;height: 104px\" colspan=\"11\">\n<h2 align=\"center\"><span style=\"color: #ff00ff\"><b>Interested Candidates Can Read the Full UPSC Geologist 2027 Notification Before Apply Online.</b></span><b></b></h2>\n</td>\n</tr>\n<tr style=\"height: 146px\">\n<td style=\"width: 149.084%;height: 146px\" colspan=\"11\">\n\n</td>\n</tr>\n<tr style=\"height: 62px\">\n<td style=\"width: 44.8244%;height: 62px\" colspan=\"5\">\n\n</td>\n<td style=\"width: 104.26%;height: 62px\" colspan=\"6\">\n\n</td>\n</tr>\n<tr style=\"height: 62px\">\n<td style=\"width: 149.084%;text-align: center;height: 62px\" colspan=\"11\">\n<h2 align=\"center\"><span style=\"color: #008000\"><b>Some Useful Important Links</b></span></h2>\n</td>\n</tr>\n<tr style=\"height: 62px\">\n<td style=\"text-align: center;height: 62px\" colspan=\"5\">\n<h2 align=\"center\"><span style=\"color: #ff00ff\"><b>Apply Online</b></span><b></b></h2>\n</td>\n<td style=\"height: 62px\" colspan=\"6\">\n<h2 align=\"center\"><a title=\"UPSC Geoscientist 2027 OTR Registration\" href=\"https://upsconline.nic.in/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\"><b>Click Here</b></a></h2>\n</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td style=\"text-align: center;width: 44.8244%\" colspan=\"5\">\n<h2 align=\"center\"><span style=\"color: #ff00ff\"><b>How To fill Form (Hindi video)</b></span><b></b></h2>\n</td>\n<td style=\"width: 104.26%\" colspan=\"6\">\n<h2 align=\"center\"><a title=\"UPSC Geoscientist 2027 OTR Registration\" href=\"https://youtu.be/IF9fcS1zvfg\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\"><b>Watch Video</b></a><b></b></h2>\n</td>\n</tr>\n<tr style=\"height: 62px\">\n<td style=\"text-align: center;height: 62px;width: 44.8244%\" col